### Register (should be 201)
POST http://localhost:3888/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "test.user@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234"
}

### Register same email again (should be 400)
POST http://localhost:3888/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "email": "test.user@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234"
}

### Register with bad data (should be 400)
POST http://localhost:3888/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Al",
  "lastName": "U",
  "email": "bad",
  "password": "123"
}

### Login (should be 200 with a token)
POST http://localhost:3888/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test.user@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234"
}

### Login with wrong password (should be 401)
POST http://localhost:3888/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test.user@example.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}


### Login and remember the token
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3888/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test.user@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234"
}

### Who am I? Send the request above first (should be 200)
GET http://localhost:3888/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### No token (should be 401)
GET http://localhost:3888/api/auth/me

### Fake token (should be 401)
GET http://localhost:3888/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer abc.def.ghi


### Register a SECOND user (should be 201)
POST http://localhost:3888/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Second",
  "lastName": "Person",
  "email": "second.person@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234"
}

### Login as the second user
# @name login2
POST http://localhost:3888/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "second.person@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234"
}

### First user: create a chat (201)
POST http://localhost:3888/api/chat/chats
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Headache questions"
}

### First user: create a chat with no title (201, title becomes "New chat")
POST http://localhost:3888/api/chat/chats
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### First user: list chats (200, newest first)
GET http://localhost:3888/api/chat/chats
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Second user: list chats (200, empty list - cannot see the first user's chats)
GET http://localhost:3888/api/chat/chats
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.$.token}}

### No token (401)
GET http://localhost:3888/api/chat/chats

### Bad title (400)
POST http://localhost:3888/api/chat/chats
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": 123
}


### Register a SECOND user (should be 201)
POST http://localhost:3888/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Second",
  "lastName": "Person",
  "email": "second.person@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234"
}

### Login as the second user
# @name login2
POST http://localhost:3888/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "second.person@example.com",
  "password": "Test1234"
}

### First user: create a chat (201)
POST http://localhost:3888/api/chat/chats
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Headache questions"
}

### First user: create a chat with no title (201, title becomes "New chat")
POST http://localhost:3888/api/chat/chats
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### First user: list chats (200, newest first)
GET http://localhost:3888/api/chat/chats
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Second user: list chats (200, empty list - cannot see the first user's chats)
GET http://localhost:3888/api/chat/chats
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.$.token}}

### No token (401)
GET http://localhost:3888/api/chat/chats

### Bad title (400)
POST http://localhost:3888/api/chat/chats
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": 123
}

### Create a chat and remember it
# @name chat1
POST http://localhost:3888/api/chat/chats
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Send a message (201, real Gemini answer, takes a few seconds)
POST http://localhost:3888/api/chat/chats/{{chat1.response.body.$.data.id}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What are the common causes of a headache?"
}

### Follow-up that needs context (the answer should refer to the headache causes)
POST http://localhost:3888/api/chat/chats/{{chat1.response.body.$.data.id}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Which of those is the most dangerous?"
}

### Open the chat (200, 4 messages)
GET http://localhost:3888/api/chat/chats/{{chat1.response.body.$.data.id}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### List chats (the title is now your first question)
GET http://localhost:3888/api/chat/chats
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### SECOND user opens the first user's chat (404 "Chat not found")
GET http://localhost:3888/api/chat/chats/{{chat1.response.body.$.data.id}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.$.token}}

### SECOND user tries to delete it (404)
DELETE http://localhost:3888/api/chat/chats/{{chat1.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login2.response.body.$.token}}

### Empty question (400)
POST http://localhost:3888/api/chat/chats/{{chat1.response.body.$.data.id}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "   "
}

### Rename (200)
PATCH http://localhost:3888/api/chat/chats/{{chat1.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Headache causes"
}

### Delete (200)
DELETE http://localhost:3888/api/chat/chats/{{chat1.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Open the deleted chat (404)
GET http://localhost:3888/api/chat/chats/{{chat1.response.body.$.data.id}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}